==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|carpentrie}}, from {{etyl|xno|en}} {{m|fro|carpenterie}}, from {{etyl|ONF.|en}} (compare French {{m|fr|charpenterie}}). See [[carpenter]].

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~|carpentries}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The trade of cutting and joining [[timber]] in order to construct [[building]]s or other structures; [[woodworking]]
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[carpenter]]'s [[workshop]].

